---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Vibe64
pageId: vibe64
permalink: /vibe64/
description: Vibe64 is an AI coding editor. You work with AI agents in sessions, each with a live Preview, a plan with checklists and a Save to GitHub.
---
<section class="page-hero wrap" aria-labelledby="page-title">
  <div class="page-hero__panel kind-vibe64 vt-vibe64">
    <div class="page-hero__text">
      <p class="overline">AI coding editor</p>
      <h1 class="page-hero__title" id="page-title">Vibe64</h1>
      <p class="page-hero__lede">An AI coding editor. You work with AI agents in sessions, and every session has a live Preview, a plan with checklists and a Save to GitHub.</p>
      <div class="btn-group" role="group" aria-label="Vibe64 links">
        <a class="btn btn--kind btn--m" href="{{ site.vibe64.url }}"><span>Visit vibe64.dev</span>{% icon "external" %}</a>
        <a class="btn btn--outlined btn--m" href="{{ site.vibe64.source }}">{% icon "branch" %}<span>Editor source</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="page-hero__art">{% cover "vibe64", "page", "center" %}</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section wrap" aria-labelledby="session-title">
  <div class="section__head">
    <p class="overline">Inside a session</p>
    <h2 class="section__title" id="session-title">Everything a session needs</h2>
  </div>
  <ul class="features kind-vibe64">
    <li class="feature">
      <span class="badge badge--cookie" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "spark" %}</span>
      <h3 class="feature__title">Your AI agents</h3>
      <p class="feature__text">Sessions are where you work with AI agents such as Claude Code, Codex and OpenCode.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="feature">
      <span class="badge badge--clover" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "preview" %}</span>
      <h3 class="feature__title">A live Preview</h3>
      <p class="feature__text">Every session has a live Preview, so you can see the software while it is being built.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="feature">
      <span class="badge badge--sunny" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "checklist" %}</span>
      <h3 class="feature__title">Plans with checklists</h3>
      <p class="feature__text">Each session's plan comes with checklists you can follow from the first step to the last.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="feature">
      <span class="badge badge--flower" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "save" %}</span>
      <h3 class="feature__title">Save to GitHub</h3>
      <p class="feature__text">When the work is ready, Save puts it on GitHub.</p>
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="section wrap" aria-labelledby="ways-title">
  <div class="section__head">
    <p class="overline">Two ways to use it</p>
    <h2 class="section__title" id="ways-title">Open source, or hosted for you</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="editions">
    <article class="edition">
      <p class="edition__tag">{% icon "branch" %}<span>Open source</span></p>
      <h3 class="edition__title">The Vibe64 editor</h3>
      <p class="edition__text">The editor is open source. Its code is on GitHub for anyone to read and build on.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--outlined btn--m" href="{{ site.vibe64.source }}">{% icon "code" %}<span>View the source</span></a>
    </article>
    <article class="edition edition--filled kind-vibe64">
      <p class="edition__tag">{% icon "server" %}<span>Hosted</span></p>
      <h3 class="edition__title">Vibe64 Online</h3>
      <p class="edition__text">The hosted version at vibe64.dev: your own workspace on a managed server.</p>
      <ul class="ticks">
        <li>{% icon "server" %}<span>Your own workspace</span></li>
        <li>{% icon "layers" %}<span>Publish to staging</span></li>
        <li>{% icon "deploy" %}<span>Deploy to production</span></li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn btn--kind btn--m" href="{{ site.vibe64.url }}"><span>Go to vibe64.dev</span>{% icon "external" %}</a>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta wrap kind-vibe64" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
  <div class="cta__inner">
    <span class="cta__shape" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <h2 class="cta__title" id="cta-title">Build with your agents in Vibe64</h2>
    <a class="btn btn--kind btn--m" href="{{ site.vibe64.url }}"><span>Visit vibe64.dev</span>{% icon "external" %}</a>
  </div>
</section>
